      "message": "I know this is a WIP - just documenting some of my thoughts so that we can talk about some next steps.\n\nHere is a link to Perfetto documentation on system tracing:\nhttps://perfetto.dev/docs/instrumentation/tracing-sdk#system-mode\n\nNotably this segment might help us make the best explanation:\n\"The main advantage of this mode is that it is possible to create fused traces where app events are overlaid on the same timeline of OS events. This enables full-stack performance investigations, looking all the way through syscalls and kernel scheduling events.\n\nThe main limitation of this mode is that it requires the external traced daemon to be up and running and reachable through the UNIX socket connection.\"",
