      "side": 1,
      "message": "While this is technically the most robust way (since Perfetto does allow you to output trace events both in-process and through the application), I want to get your thoughts on something. \n\nI am wondering if there would ever be a use case where a client would want both of these enabled at once. We should talk about whether we want to offer this feature even though no one has requested it yet or if we should just use one bool to allow picking between one or the other.",
